gantt
    title FreeRTOS Task Scheduling (10ms Window)
    dateFormat  s
    axisFormat %L ms

    section DataGenTask (High Priority)
    Wake, Synthesize, Print (approx 4.5ms) :active, a1, 0, 4.5
    Sleep (Yield to OS)                   :a2, 4.5, 10

    section DiagTask (Low Priority)
    Blink LED, Calc CPU Load (approx 0.5ms): b1, 4.5, 5
    Sleep (Yield to OS)                   : b2, 5, 10

    section Idle Task
    Wait for next tick                    : c1, 5, 10
